    "detailed_description": "That Way! is a platformer about planning your path to reach a series of guarded vaults. For each vault, create a list of commands that will help your partner reach it. When you are ready, send them to him one by one to get him there. <br><br>You will navigate through 50 levels, each containing more hazards than the last. Plan carefully and watch your timing to ensure your victory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Shift: Switch between &quot;Plan&quot; and &quot;Run&quot; modes<br></li><li>Ctrl/Command + Arrows: Pan Camera<br></li><li>Esc: Pause</li></ul><br><strong>Plan Mode Controls</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>WASD: Add new command<br></li><li>Up/Down Arrows: Scroll through commands</li></ul><br><strong>Run Mode Controls</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enter: Send command</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "That Way! is a platformer about planning your path to reach a series of guarded vaults. For each vault, create a list of commands that will help your partner reach it. When you are ready, send them to him one by one to get him there. <br><br>You will navigate through 50 levels, each containing more hazards than the last. Plan carefully and watch your timing to ensure your victory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Shift: Switch between &quot;Plan&quot; and &quot;Run&quot; modes<br></li><li>Ctrl/Command + Arrows: Pan Camera<br></li><li>Esc: Pause</li></ul><br><strong>Plan Mode Controls</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>WASD: Add new command<br></li><li>Up/Down Arrows: Scroll through commands</li></ul><br><strong>Run Mode Controls</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enter: Send command</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Help your partner perform the heist of a lifetime! Send him instructions for how to get to each vault and make a getaway with your newly found fortune!",
